  "body": "Hello everyone,\nI'm glad to join you.\nI have a problem with the queue of ART 1.25.1, and ART 1.24.5. on **Mac mini M4 OS 15.1**.\nThe problem is as follows:\nWhen I drag a photo into the queue, ART crashes immediately and every time.\nThe Mac sends me a long error report, the beginning of which I'm copying to you.\n\nOn the other hand, the queue works fine on RawTherapee.\nHas anyone encountered this problem before?\nDoes anyone know the solution?\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/41c6890f-639f-4b21-ab53-66b5e92018b5)\n",
